<!--
  Lab tablet screen (landscape). The scene scales it down; tablet.ts builds
  the device body and side grips around it. Pages are shown/hidden by id.
-->
<style>
  .screen {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 600px;
    height: 340px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    padding-left: 16px;
    padding-right: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    background-color: #16181c;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-color: #2c3038;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .top {
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .brand {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f2f2f0;
  }

  .tabs {
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .page {
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .h {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f2f2f0;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .lbl {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #8f95a1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .txt {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #c9ccd3;
  }

  .status {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f5b041;
  }

  .row {
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .cols {
    flex-direction: row;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .col {
    flex-direction: column;
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-basis: 0;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .k {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #8fb8ff;
  }

  .center {
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
</style>
<div class="screen">
  <div class="top">
    <div id="app-title" class="brand">Server Explorer</div>
    <div id="tabs" class="tabs" style="display: none">
      <Button class="hb" id="tab-lab" size="sm"><ButtonLabel id="tab-lab-label">Lab</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="tab-server" size="sm"><ButtonLabel id="tab-server-label">Server</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="tab-explode" size="sm"><ButtonLabel id="tab-explode-label">Explode</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="tab-controls" size="sm"><ButtonLabel id="tab-controls-label">Controls</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="tab-debug" size="sm"><ButtonLabel id="tab-debug-label">Debug</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="page-safety" class="page">
    <div class="h">Safety brief</div>
    <div class="txt">1. Wear your ESD wrist strap, clipped to bare metal.</div>
    <div class="txt">2. Shut the server down properly. Check with the site team first.</div>
    <div class="txt">3. Unplug all power cords before opening the lid.</div>
    <div class="txt">4. Heatsinks and drives can be hot. Let them cool.</div>
    <div class="txt">5. Watch for sharp edges inside the chassis.</div>
    <div class="txt">6. Never lift a server alone. Use a lift or a second person.</div>
    <div class="txt">7. Handle parts by the edges. Use anti-static bags.</div>
    <div class="txt">8. If unsure, stop and ask.</div>
    <div class="center">
      <Button class="hb" id="btn-start-lab" variant="primary"><ButtonLabel id="btn-start-lab-label">Start lab</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="page-lab" class="page" style="display: none">
    <div class="lbl">Current part</div>
    <div id="info-title" class="h">Ready</div>
    <div id="info-body" class="txt">The server is in rack 3: grab its side (or point at its case and hold the trigger) and slide it out along the rails. Screws need your left hand (the screwdriver); pinch it to swap hand / screwdriver.</div>
    <div id="info-status" class="status">Next steps show here.</div>
    <div class="row">
      <Button class="hb" id="btn-reset"><ButtonLabel>Reset lab</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="btn-safety"><ButtonLabel>Safety brief</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="btn-hud"><ButtonLabel id="btn-hud-label">Heads-up: off</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="btn-recall"><ButtonLabel>Reset view</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="page-server" class="page" style="display: none">
    <div class="lbl">Place the server</div>
    <div class="row">
      <Button class="hb" id="srv-here"><ButtonLabel>Bring here</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="srv-rotate"><ButtonLabel>Rotate 90°</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div class="lbl" style="margin-top: 10px">Nudge</div>
    <div class="row">
      <Button class="hb" id="srv-up"><ButtonLabel>Up</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="srv-down"><ButtonLabel>Down</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="srv-closer"><ButtonLabel>Closer</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="srv-further"><ButtonLabel>Further</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div id="srv-status" class="status">To move it by hand: grab its side (or point at its case and hold the trigger).</div>
  </div>

  <div id="page-explode" class="page" style="display: none">
    <div id="exp-status" class="lbl">Explode parts out so you can see and grab them. Grabbed parts refit like normal.</div>
    <div class="row">
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-all" variant="primary"><ButtonLabel id="exp-all-label">Explode all</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-lid"><ButtonLabel>Lid</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-drives"><ButtonLabel>Drives</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-fans"><ButtonLabel>Fans</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-dimms"><ButtonLabel>DIMMs</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-heatsinks"><ButtonLabel>Heatsinks</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-cpus"><ButtonLabel>CPUs</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="exp-cards"><ButtonLabel>Cards</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="page-controls" class="page" style="display: none">
    <div class="cols">
      <div class="col">
        <div class="h">Controllers</div>
        <div class="k">Trigger</div>
        <div class="txt">Click tabs, buttons, doors, drawers. Hold on a part to pull it out; hold on the server case to move the server.</div>
        <div class="k">Right grip (up close)</div>
        <div class="txt">Grab a part or the tablet handles. Right stick: push it away / closer.</div>
        <div class="k">Grip on the server's side</div>
        <div class="txt">Carry it (turns left / right only). Line it up in front of a slot: it slides in on the rails.</div>
        <div class="k">Left controller = screwdriver</div>
        <div class="txt">Tip on a screw. X: undo. Y: do up. 2 s between turns. Left grip on nothing: hand / screwdriver.</div>
        <div class="k">Sticks and A</div>
        <div class="txt">Left: walk. Right: teleport / turn. Double-press A: menu (Room / AR / Black, Reset view).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="h">Hands</div>
        <div class="k">Pinch (point)</div>
        <div class="txt">Click. Pinch and hold on a part to pull it out.</div>
        <div class="k">Fingertip</div>
        <div class="txt">Press tabs, buttons, doors, drawers and the tablet.</div>
        <div class="k">Right pinch (up close)</div>
        <div class="txt">Grab a part or the tablet handles.</div>
        <div class="k">Pinch the server's side</div>
        <div class="txt">Carry it with one hand. In front of a slot it slides in on the rails.</div>
        <div class="k">Left hand = screwdriver</div>
        <div class="txt">Touch a screw with the tip. Left pinch on nothing: hand / screwdriver. Back of the open right hand to your face 3 s: menu.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="page-debug" class="page" style="display: none">
    <div id="dbg-status" class="lbl">Debug tools.</div>
    <div class="row">
      <Button class="hb" id="dbg-lid"><ButtonLabel id="dbg-lid-label">Lid off</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="dbg-remove"><ButtonLabel id="dbg-remove-label">Remove one of each</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="dbg-controls"><ButtonLabel id="dbg-controls-label">Open all controls</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <Button class="hb" id="dbg-slots"><ButtonLabel id="dbg-slots-label">Show slots</ButtonLabel></Button>
      <Button class="hb" id="dbg-teleport"><ButtonLabel id="dbg-teleport-label">Movement: on</ButtonLabel></Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
